# Copy to .env.local and fill in for Phase 3+ (official API integration).
# Never commit a real key. Phase 1/2 of this app runs entirely on seeded/mock data
# and does not read this file.

# Server-side only. Do NOT prefix with NEXT_PUBLIC_ — this must never reach the client bundle.
# Supercell API keys are locked to the IP address they were created from (see docs/discovery.md
# section 1.2). If you redeploy to a host with a different egress IP, you must generate a new key
# at https://developer.brawlstars.com from that IP and update this value manually.
BRAWL_STARS_API_KEY=
